Subject: [PATCH 7/9] fix(pen): write currentItemStrokeWidthKey together with
 the numeric width

Verified in the installed @excalidraw 0.18.0-c0ad61c: updateScene is a plain
setState and only restoreAppState derives the key from the number, while
freeDrawEngine reads the key. The dock and contextual toolbar wrote only the
number, so the pen stayed on 'medium'. Tests: stability-pen-width (3).
Not verified in a browser.
